OL,3,GNEWSAUnion announces strikes over
OL,4,Auniversity restructure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA union which represents staff at the
OL,7,FUniversity of Nottingham has announced
OL,8,Fit will take strike action over
OL,9,Frestructuring proposals.
OL,11,FThe University and College Union (UCU)
OL,12,Fsaid its members would strike on 30
OL,13,FSeptember and 1 October and would then
OL,14,Fcarry out "sustained strike action"
OL,15,Ffrom 5 October to 11 December over the
OL,16,FFuture Nottingham restructuring plans.
OL,18,FThe university said its Future
OL,19,FNottingham proposals were about
OL,20,F"future-proofing" its institution in
OL,21,Fresponse to "increasing challenges" in
OL,22,Fthe sector.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
