OL,3,GNEWSAUnion announces strikes over
OL,4,Auniversity restructure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the University of
OL,7,FNottingham said it was "disappointed"
OL,8,Fby the timing of industrial action and
OL,9,Fsaid many students would be
OL,10,F"unaffected" by the strikes.
